B.eg2=new A.dd("q12",B.cf,"","Love one another, but make not a bond of love:\nLet it rather be a moving sea between the shores of your souls.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.yM)
B.efR=new A.dd("q13",B.cf,"","And stand together yet not too near together:\nFor the pillars of the temple stand apart,\nAnd the oak tree and the cypress grow not in each other\u2019s shadow.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.yM)
B.efk=new A.dd("q14",B.cf,"","Love gives naught but itself and takes naught but from itself.\nLove possesses not nor would it be possessed;\nFor love is sufficient unto love.","Kahlil Gibran, The Prophet (1923)",B.CZ)
B.efG=new A.dd("q15",B.cf,"","Many waters cannot quench love, neither can the floods drown it.","Song of Solomon 8:7, King James Bible (1611)",B.yN)
B.efo=new A.dd("q16",B.cf,"","Set me as a seal upon thine heart.","Song of Solomon 8:6, King James Bible (1611)",B.rk)
